    {
      "source": "<ul class=\"tag-list-long\">\n<li><a href=\"SpringTransactionAnnotationParser.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.transaction.annotation\"><code>SpringTransactionAnnotationParser</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"Ejb3TransactionAnnotationParser.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.transaction.annotation\"><code>Ejb3TransactionAnnotationParser</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../../../../serialized-form.html#org.springframework.transaction.annotation.JtaTransactionAnnotationParser\">Serialized Form</a></li>\n</ul>",
      "translation": "<ul class=\"tag-list-long\">\n<li><a href=\"SpringTransactionAnnotationParser.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.transaction.annotation\"><code>SpringTransactionAnnotationParser</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"Ejb3TransactionAnnotationParser.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.transaction.annotation\"><code>Ejb3TransactionAnnotationParser</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../../../../serialized-form.html#org.springframework.transaction.annotation.JtaTransactionAnnotationParser\">Serialized Form</a></li>\n</ul>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "If this method returns <code>false</code>, the methods on the given class\nwill not get traversed for <code>#parseTransactionAnnotation</code> introspection.\nReturning <code>false</code> is therefore an optimization for non-affected\nclasses, whereas <code>true</code> simply means that the class needs to get\nfully introspected for each method on the given class individually.",
      "translation": "如果此方法返回 `<code>false</code>`，则不会针对给定类上的方法进行 `<code>#parseTransactionAnnotation</code>` 内省遍历。因此，返回 `<code>false</code>` 是对不受影响类的优化，而返回 `<code>true</code>` 仅意味着需要针对给定类上的每个方法单独进行完全内省。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The returned attribute will typically (but not necessarily) be of type\n<a href=\"../interceptor/RuleBasedTransactionAttribute.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.transaction.interceptor\"><code>RuleBasedTransactionAttribute</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回的属性通常（但不一定）为 <a href=\"../interceptor/RuleBasedTransactionAttribute.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.transaction.interceptor\"><code>RuleBasedTransactionAttribute</code></a> 类型。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "This essentially parses a known transaction annotation into Spring's metadata\nattribute class. Returns <code>null</code> if the method/class is not transactional.",
      "translation": "这本质上是将已知的交易注解解析为 Spring 的元数据属性类。如果方法或类不是事务性的，则返回 `<code>null</code>`。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"TransactionAnnotationParser.html#isCandidateClass(java.lang.Class)\">TransactionAnnotationParser</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"TransactionAnnotationParser.html#isCandidateClass(java.lang.Class)\">TransactionAnnotationParser</a></code></span>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"TransactionAnnotationParser.html#parseTransactionAnnotation(java.lang.reflect.AnnotatedElement)\">TransactionAnnotationParser</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"TransactionAnnotationParser.html#parseTransactionAnnotation(java.lang.reflect.AnnotatedElement)\">TransactionAnnotationParser</a></code></span>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Strategy implementation for parsing JTA 1.2's <code>Transactional</code> annotation.",
      "translation": "用于解析 JTA 1.2 的<code>Transactional</code>注解的策略实现。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Determine whether the given class is a candidate for transaction attributes\nin the annotation format of this <code>TransactionAnnotationParser</code>.",
      "translation": "确定给定类是否为该 `<code>TransactionAnnotationParser` 的注解格式的事务属性候选者。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Parse the transaction attribute for the given method or class,\nbased on an annotation type understood by this parser.",
      "translation": "根据此解析器理解的注解类型，解析给定方法或类的交易属性。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
