      "translation": "`<code><a href=\"TransactionAnnotationParser.html#isCandidateClass(java.lang.Class)\">isCandidateClass</a></code>` 接口 `<code><a href=\"TransactionAnnotationParser.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.transaction.annotation\">TransactionAnnotationParser</a></code>` 中",
