    {
      "source": "<code>false</code> if the class is known to have no transaction\nannotations at class or method level; <code>true</code> otherwise. The default\nimplementation returns <code>true</code>, leading to regular introspection.",
      "translation": "如果已知该类在类或方法级别没有事务注解，则返回`false`；否则返回`true`。默认实现返回`true`，从而进行常规内省。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>targetClass</code> - the class to introspect",
      "translation": "<code>targetClass</code> - 要检查的类",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>element</code> - the annotated method or class",
      "translation": "<code>element</code> - 已注解的方法或类",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "the configured transaction attribute, or <code>null</code> if none found",
      "translation": "配置的事务属性，或者如果未找到则为<code>null</code>",
